error[E0277]: `NotAnError` cannot be the error of a request handler's `Result`
 --> tests/ui/extractors/not_an_error.rs:7:9
  |
7 |     app.map_get("/", async || Err::<&'static str, _>(NotAnError));
  |         ^^^^^^^ not an error
  |
help: the trait `IntoError` is not implemented for `NotAnError`
 --> tests/ui/extractors/not_an_error.rs:3:1
  |
3 | struct NotAnError;
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: the `Err` of a handler's `Result<T, E>` is turned into a `volga::error::Error` and handed to the error handler; `E` can be `Error`, `std::io::Error`, `StatusCode`, `(StatusCode, E)`, `String` or `&'static str`
  = note: implement `volga::error::IntoError` for `NotAnError`, or `From<NotAnError>` for `volga::error::Error`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `IntoError`:
            &'static str
            (StatusCode, E)
            Box<(dyn std::error::Error + Send + Sync + 'static)>
            Box<str>
            Cow<'static, str>
            Problem<E>
            StatusCode
            String
  = note: required for `Result<&str, NotAnError>` to implement `IntoResponse`
note: required by a bound in `router::<impl App>::map_get`
 --> src/app/router.rs
  |
  |     pub fn map_get<'a, F, R, Args, M>(&'a mut self, pattern: &'a str, handler: F) -> Route<'a>
  |            ------- required by a bound in this associated function
...
  |         R: IntoResponse + 'static,
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `router::<impl App>::map_get`
